# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Excluded from the published npm tarball.
#
# package.json `files[]` whitelists whole directories (tools/, agents/, ...),
# so without this file every stray build artifact inside them gets published.
# v1.4.0 shipped 11 compiled .pyc files this way.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Maintainer-only tooling (the agent compiler, not needed by end users)
scratch/

# Secrets - only .env.example ships
.env
.env.local

# Local test/render artifacts
.tts_cache/
*.log
